79528c55699302c7ccbeb3cf932dcf7baa86ba28e8d852df", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-08/MATHPKG-455529bd9f8f968c6fe6b264/attachments/solution_text_03.txt", "sha256": "7de2c9ae2e797308853410506b14d1eeb5ee210e300898837db0b26f0a876420", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-09-08/MATHPKG-455529bd9f8f968c6fe6b264", "original_sha256": "08c404edf463290da005eed58fe766bf7ea043f999e99cba80ed050010f27fa0", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-bea4330dcbb6e16301a55f1e", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 2, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["recurrence_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/c291b2f095791904a358923878acfd5b55701e71dae6dec9cef3e378613d10bd.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "c291b2f095791904a358923878acfd5b55701e71dae6dec9cef3e378613d10bd", "user_turn_count": 4, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 578], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "b751f18da211ad7e85bb4d23bbf89003d756ac54c9e35673f39317ec070f8f20", "role": "user", "sequence": 2}, {"character_range": [0, 534], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "6a16dfd131bf5ff7c076208f57036d5f7510b4e95f4a5ef15313aa13a3749e71", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}, {"character_range": [0, 1043], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "06c1ce03b98b47e9347b92b854da38a58bdf1e96d2b6fbb509f3d7d874502e79", "role": "user", "sequence": 8}, {"character_range": [0, 100], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "9f7a8b120b41d01aa99b904dbab000d5999f3573875d6c4fc234f06b65f62c5b", "role": "user", "sequence": 11}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "这道题我有点卡住了。我一开始想到用轮换对称性去做，它就等于两倍的三重积分：\n\n∭ (x + y + z) dx dy dz\n\n我一开始想的是把 x + y + z 变成 1 然后代入，但这是三重积分，不是曲面积分，所以不能这么代。这样就还是两倍的积分区域上对 (x + y + z) dx dy dz 的积分。\n\n接下来关于 x + y + z，我忘记是 x² + y² + z² = r²，还是 x + y + z = r² 了。如果按 x + y + z = r² 换成一个球体去做，这个球体很明显被三个坐标平面所切，所以应该是八分之一球（投影到面是四分之一圆）。那这个应该怎么做呢？\n\n还是说，它其实是六倍的三重积分：\n\n6 ∭ x dx dy dz\n\n如果把 dz 提出来，积分区域是 0 到 1：\n\n∫ (0到1) [ ∬ x dx dy ] dz\n\n里面的二重积分区域是四分之一圆，换成极坐标系去做，θ 的积分区域是 0 到 2π，r 的积分区域是 0 到 z，把 x 换成 r cosθ，再乘一个极坐标雅可比行列式 r，也就是：\n\n∫ (0到2π) dθ ∫ (0到z) r cosθ · r dr\n\n但这样算出来很明显等于 0，因为 cosθ 在 0 到 2π 上的积分等于 0。可这道题的答案显然不等于 0。\n\n你看我这是哪里出问题了？\n"}